    15["Reservations System (legacy)<br/>[Software System]<br/>Existing system: non-pool<br/>reservations, prices, stay<br/>settlement and refunds at<br/>checkout, cancellations,<br/>manager reports. No API, only<br/>file exchange. Blocks a room<br/>pool that only we sell."]
